OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of tower moves forward
OL,4,Aafter delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council said "significant progress"
OL,7,Fhad been made with plans for the
OL,8,Fdelayed demolition of a block of flats.
OL,10,FSt Peter's Court in Lowestoft, Suffolk,
OL,11,Fwas marked for demolition in 2023 after
OL,12,FEast Suffolk Council said it would cost
OL,13,F#23m to maintain the site.
OL,15,FEveryone living in the 90 flats in the
OL,16,Ftown's only tower block were offered
OL,17,Falternative accommodation in the area.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
