OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of tower moves forward
OL,4,Aafter delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said work to safely "remove
OL,7,Fall known asbestos containing
OL,8,Fmaterials" was nearly complete and the
OL,9,Fnext step would be to appoint a
OL,10,Fcontractor to carry out the demolition.
